## Change

1. `dashboard/lib/storytime/print/student-book.ts`, `.more-*` CSS only:
   - `.more-row` gap 4mm to 1.5mm: the sentence dot stands 1.5 mm after the text (spec: 2 mm or less).
   - `.more-text` flex 1 to none: the text box ends at the text, not at the right end of the row.
   - `.more-pic` adds `margin-left: auto`: the picture and its dot stand at the right end of the row, so the dot gap is 40 mm or more.
   - `.more-pic` keeps gap 2mm, so the picture dot stays at the left edge of its picture box (the P9-B9 form does not change).
2. `dashboard/lib/storytime/manual.ts`, `moreKey` only: the pair line is `<text> = the picture in row <k>` (k = `pictureOrder.indexOf(index) + 1`, counted from the top). The key heading and the read line do not change. No new Thai text.

